--- !u!114 &419053743
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 419053731}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 14ce5c596a29e284c91b0e2209200b81, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  encounterID: 
  active: 1
  blockInteraction: 0
  failBranch: 
  dialog:
  - text: "Hey Storm.. What are you\u2026"
    name: Stretch
    character: {fileID: 1320128508}
    pose: HandsOnHips
    cameraAngle: 0
    face: Happy
  - text: Storm! No! We're not killers!
    name: Stretch
    character: {fileID: 1320128508}
    pose: Explaining
    cameraAngle: 2
    face: Mad
  - text: "I\u2019m just doing what needs to be done. We have our orders, Stretch.
      You know them just as well as I do\r\n"
    name: Storm
    character: {fileID: 176893421}
    pose: Explaining
    cameraAngle: 0
    face: Confused
  - text: "You\u2019re not thinking straight! Storm, this isn\u2019t you!\r\n"
    name: Stretch
    character: {fileID: 1320128508}
    pose: Explaining
    cameraAngle: 2
    face: Mad
  - text: 'Tell me what you were doing here, Jack. Are you working with the kid?

'
    name: Storm
    character: {fileID: 176893421}
    pose: HandsOnHips
    cameraAngle: 3
    face: Surprised
  - text: "N.. No! I don\u2019t know what I was doing\u2026 I was being a detective,
      that\u2019s all"
    name: Spartan Jack
    character: {fileID: 1923886051}
    pose: SittingDown
    cameraAngle: 4
    face: Confused
  - text: "Pfft, detectives don\u2019t break into the dojo at night. And they definitely
      don\u2019t steal our most valuable family weapons. I saw the lockpicks in your
      pocket."
    name: Storm
    character: {fileID: 176893421}
    pose: ArmsCrossed
    cameraAngle: 3
    face: Confused
  - text: ...
    name: Spartan Jack
    character: {fileID: 1923886051}
    pose: SittingDown
    cameraAngle: 4
    face: Blank
  - text: "That\u2019s right, stay silent, I\u2019m onto you. You\u2019re not just
      some random kid, you\u2019re a SPARTAN!\r\n"
    name: Storm
    character: {fileID: 176893421}
    pose: Explaining
    cameraAngle: 3
    face: Mad
  - text: "That\u2019s.. A thing? Besides just me?"
    name: Spartan Jack
    character: {fileID: 1923886051}
    pose: SittingDown
    cameraAngle: 4
    face: Confused
  - text: "I dunno, Storm, he seems like a normal kid. He might just be someone\u2019s
      pawn"
    name: Stretch
    character: {fileID: 1320128508}
    pose: Embarrassed
    cameraAngle: 2
    face: Confused
  - text: Ex-CUSE me? A PAWN?
    name: Spartan Jack
    character: {fileID: 1923886051}
    pose: SittingDown
    cameraAngle: 4
    face: Mad
  - text: "You think it\u2019s a COINCIDENCE that just as we start having problems
      with the rival dojo\u2013 who call themselves the Spartans\u2013 this kid named
      Spartan Jack appears out of nowhere with some crazy new weapon?"
    name: Storm
    character: {fileID: 176893421}
    pose: Sassy
    cameraAngle: 3
    face: Confused
  - text: "Jack\u2019s family sword doesn\u2019t even do anything. He showed it to
      me last night.. he did some like, kicky thingy and broke through the wall but
      that was it. Kind of a cute trick \r\n"
    name: Stretch
    character: {fileID: 1320128508}
    pose: Embarrassed
    cameraAngle: 0
    face: Confused
  - text: EX-CUUUUSE ME?!?!
    name: Spartan Jack
    character: {fileID: 1923886051}
    pose: SittingDown
    cameraAngle: 4
    face: Mad
  - text: "Hm. Even if his sword is useless, JACK might be dangerous, with his nose
      in our top secret business. And that Spartan name... Ugh, I do so much to maintain
      order around here, you know I don\u2019t like when the pieces don\u2019t fit"
    name: Storm
    character: {fileID: 176893421}
    pose: Explaining
    cameraAngle: 3
    face: Surprised
  - text: "*Ungghhh* I\u2019m getting an awful headache. Let\u2019s get this over
      with."
    name: Storm
    character: {fileID: 176893421}
    pose: Unsheath
    cameraAngle: 7
    face: Dissapointed
  - text: (Storm presses the blade of her axe to your neck)
    name: 
    character: {fileID: 176893421}
    pose: SittingDown
    cameraAngle: 4
    face: Surprised
  turnToFace: 0
  snapPlayerPosition: 0
