--- !u!114 &1608435447
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1608435442}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 14ce5c596a29e284c91b0e2209200b81, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  encounterID: 
  active: 1
  blockInteraction: 0
  failBranch: 
  dialog:
  - text: Mister Chrome Dome- , tell me WHY I should trust a thing you say
    name: Storm
    character: {fileID: 922841872}
    pose: ArmsCrossed
    cameraAngle: 5
    face: Surprised
  - text: Jade is trying to kill me
    name: Chrome Dome
    character: {fileID: 1848653214}
    pose: SittingDown
    cameraAngle: 4
    face: Angry
  - text: "On a more pressing matter, *I* am trying to kill you. And gee I wonder
      why Jade would ever do such a thing. If you don\u2019t recall, you RUINED HER
      LIFE!! You took EVERYTHING from her!"
    name: Storm
    character: {fileID: 922841872}
    pose: Explaining
    cameraAngle: 3
    face: Mad
  - text: "She\u2019s trying to kill us both! You see how she acted when you cornered
      her on that rooftop. What do you think she will do when she has the power of
      a thousand generations"
    name: Chrome Dome
    character: {fileID: 1848653214}
    pose: SittingDown
    cameraAngle: 4
    face: Confused
  - text: "I tried to take the blade from her\u2026 but in the end, you and your
      con artist family were the ones who succeeded"
    name: Chrome Dome
    character: {fileID: 1848653214}
    pose: SittingDown
    cameraAngle: 4
    face: Confused
  - text: "Oh so I\u2019m the thief and the murderer here, I see"
    name: Storm
    character: {fileID: 922841872}
    pose: ArmsCrossed
    cameraAngle: 3
    face: Surprised
  - text: You locked away her sword and you kicked her off a rooftop! She wants revenge
    name: Chrome Dome
    character: {fileID: 1848653214}
    pose: SittingDown
    cameraAngle: 4
    face: Angry
  - text: "Um it\u2019s MY family\u2019s sword and you don\u2019t know a thing about
      what she wants"
    name: Storm
    character: {fileID: 922841872}
    pose: Sass
    cameraAngle: 6
    face: Mad
  - text: "Look, While I don\u2019t agree with my sister\u2019s methods, she and
      I both agreed on one thing. You\u2019re psychotic. Jade is.. was.. my best
      friend"
    name: Storm
    character: {fileID: 922841872}
    pose: Explaining
    cameraAngle: 2
    face: Confused
  - text: "What happened on the rooftop was an accident\u2026 Right, Stretch? Not
      everyone is a traitor? Right?"
    name: Storm
    character: {fileID: 922841872}
    pose: HandsOnHips
    cameraAngle: 2
    face: Confused
  - text: (Stretch nods her head) Mind games, Storm. Stay strong
    name: Stretch
    character: {fileID: 1108553781}
    pose: HandsOnHips
    cameraAngle: 2
    face: Confused
  - text: YOU ARE THE REASON EVERYONE IS DEAD. ALL I EVER DID WAS PROTECT THE SWORD
    name: Storm
    character: {fileID: 922841872}
    pose: Explaining
    cameraAngle: 6
    face: Mad
  - text: YOU KILLED HER PARENTS AND I TOOK HER INTO MY FAMILY. YOU DROVE HER MAD
      FOR REVENGE. I LOCKED AWAY THE BLADE TO PROTECT MY FAMILY. TO PROTECT ALL OF
      US
    name: Storm
    character: {fileID: 922841872}
    pose: Explaining
    cameraAngle: 7
    face: Mad
  - text: BUT I SEE MAYBE JADE WAS RIGHT. MAYBE KILLING YOU IS THE WAY
    name: Storm
    character: {fileID: 922841872}
    pose: ArmsCrossed
    cameraAngle: 3
    face: Mad
  - text: Stretch? Am I making a big mistake here?
    name: Storm
    character: {fileID: 922841872}
    pose: ArmsCrossed
    cameraAngle: 0
    face: Surprised
  - text: (For once, stretch is quiet)
    name: 
    character: {fileID: 1108553781}
    pose: Embarrassed
    cameraAngle: 0
    face: Blank
  - text: 'Spartan Jack... All of you...

      Jade has been feeding you lies! The
      Spartans know the true prophecy - Storm''s weapon was never hers, she STOLE
      IT! Storm, your family was never meant to have the s--'
    name: Chrome Dome
    character: {fileID: 1848653214}
    pose: SittingDown
    cameraAngle: 4
    face: Mad
  turnToFace: 0
  snapPlayerPosition: 0
